# Conformance probe pack for six-bit armor with absent-value sentinels
# (spec 0.14 ruling 12, spec 0.9). Public. The type field's value 63 (the
# character `w`) means "no value"; an optional field with a sentinel is
# written, and counted in L, when its key is absent.
format        conformance-armor-absent
version       0.14.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          bits
word_bytes    1
bit_order     msb
armor         sixbit

field  probe.n  0:0:6   uint  absent 63
field  probe.x  0:6:6   uint
field  probe.y  0:12:6  uint  optional absent 0
